    "id": "p5-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Simplify\n\n$$\\frac{x}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{(x+1)(x+2)}.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{x+1}{x+2}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{(x+1)(x+2)}&=\\frac{x(x+2)+1}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\\\&=\\frac{(x+1)^2}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\\\&=\\frac{x+1}{x+2}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe original expression is defined for $x\\ne-1,-2$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
